    -----------------------------------------

.         keep if _merge == 3
(7,837 observations deleted)

.         drop _merge

.         // School-Leaving Degree: lb0191. This variable is not included into the data due to many missing values.
.         
.         * Merge country
.         merge 1:1 pid syear using "$IN/pgen.dta", keepusing(pgnation)
(variable syear was long, now double to accommodate using data's values)

    Result                      Number of obs
    -----------------------------------------
    Not matched                         7,837
        from master                         0  (_merge==1)
        from using                      7,837  (_merge==2)

    Matched                            27,391  (_merge==3)
    -----------------------------------------

.         keep if _merge == 3
(7,837 observations deleted)

.         drop _merge

.         // pgnation: the nationality of the responder.
.         
.         * Merge political preference from pl.dta
.         merge m:1 pid syear using "$IN/pl.dta", keepusing(plh0004)
